     72  02fc							; ---- position an object: A = x, X = 0 for P0 or 2 for M0 (pass x + 1 for M0: it lands a pixel left
     73  02fc							; of P0 for the same strobe). Coarse RESx from a divide-by-15 loop, then HMOVE for the rest: the
     74  02fc							; strobe ends at cycle 5n + 18 (n loop passes), so P0's coarse x is 15(n - 1) + 6 and HMTab moves
     75  02fc							; it r - 6 (r = x mod 15). Takes three lines; HMCLR at the end. Kept within a page: a branch across
     76  02fc							; one would add a cycle.
     77  02fc					      IF	(<.) > $E0
     78  0300		       00 00 00 00	      ALIGN	256
     79  0300					      ENDIF
